  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a wok over medium heat.",
    "Mince the garlic and saut\u00187 in the wok for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mushrooms and red onion to the wok and cook until tender, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the parsley, dill, salt, and black pepper to the wok and stir to combine.",
    "Stir in the Greek yogurt until well combined.",
    "Add the lemon juice and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, until the yogurt has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in the fresh mint and cracked pepper.",
